      "content": "thanks for that. i'm trying to dig a bit deeper into the \"effectiveness\" part you mentioned. i've seen a lot of stuff online where people claim mandates don't actually work or that the data is being manipulated to make them look better. how should i categorize those types of arguments in my paper? are they just people spreading misinformation or is there a legitimate scientific basis for questioning the mandates?",
